2. Proper dashboard: ratatui (tui-rs) + crossterm
If you want panels and mini-charts (sparklines for PWI, entropy, momentum), go with a TUI crate.

a) Dependencies
[dependencies]
crossterm = "0.28"
ratatui = { version = "0.28", default-features = false, features = ["crossterm"] }
b) Architecture idea
Your existing pipeline produces a MetricsSnapshot struct every 100ms.

You send it through a channel to a UI task.

The UI task runs a ratatui render loop and updates widgets from the latest snapshot.

Rough struct:

